SMS Connect Assistant / 短信互联助手
Maintained by 1Fann: https://github.com/1Fann/sms-connect-assistant

Derived from SMS Gateway for Android by capcom6 and contributors:
https://github.com/capcom6/android-sms-gateway
Upstream baseline: 81b34154aae8759171ee254f742dbe6489be60fa
Upstream and this fork: Apache License, Version 2.0.
This distribution includes modifications for an iPhone PWA, private HTTPS,
default SMS handling, certificate management, and optional Root monitoring.
Original source notices are retained. This fork is not an upstream release.

Major third-party components include AndroidX, Kotlin, Ktor, Netty, OkHttp,
Conscrypt, acme4j, Google libphonenumber, libphonenumber-js, React, and Vite.
Their licenses apply independently; dependency versions are declared in
Gradle files and pwa/package.json / pwa/pnpm-lock.yaml.
